Find the build helper in the source tree, not in the build directory.

src/meson.build runs build/utils.sh to assemble the JavaScript bundle the
greeter embeds, but names it relative to the BUILD directory -- which is
only right when that directory is the source tree's build/, where the
script happens to live.  Any other build directory fails at configure time
with the helper not found.  The script belongs to the source tree, so name
it there.

